=== assertions
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Wallet
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Coffee
2024-01-02 * cafe
    Expenses:Coffee   3.20 EUR
    Assets:Wallet    -3.20 EUR = -6.40 EUR
2024-01-02 * cafe again, same day
    Expenses:Coffee   3.20 EUR
    Assets:Wallet
2024-01-03 * wrong
    Expenses:Coffee   1 EUR = 1 EUR
    Assets:Wallet
--- out
10: ASSERT_FAILED
